1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,513
Genesis at full power. Starting the jump.

2
00:00:12,583 --> 00:00:14,522
Doctor? Can you hear me?

3
00:00:14,542 --> 00:00:18,731
We hear you! The signal is weak, but you're
there. What year is it?

4
00:00:18,751 --> 00:00:21,559
2026. We made it.

5
00:00:21,579 --> 00:00:27,431
Listen to me. We have the Earth observation
data. Investigate, identify the risks and help

6
00:00:27,451 --> 00:00:30,257
people decide. This is where it all begins.
